  are also deliberately absent. The first two were merged into product-d365.html;
  the third was renamed to product-chatadmin.html when the admin product was named
  ChatAdmin. All three survive only as noindex <meta refresh> stubs that forward
  the old URLs; check-site.py fails the build if any is added here.

  /tools/level0/ is mounted at build time by build-site.py from the separate
  level0-web project; it is not a file in this source tree.
-->
